      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's so much easier to believe that you are the problem when you're already feeling this low. You are a whole, complete person, and your presence is not a drain, but a part of the tapestry of your life. The exhaustion you feel is real, but it doesn't mean you are responsible for your sister's struggles or that you are a burden. Please consider speaking with someone who can help you navigate these intense feelings of guilt and self-blame.",
      "source": "target",
